---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About CarScratch - How It Works"
  description="Learn about CarScratch, the UK and Isle of Man vehicle information aggregator. Discover how we collect and display vehicle data from official sources."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">About CarScratch</h1>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-300">
      <!-- What is CarScratch -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">What is CarScratch?</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          CarScratch is a free vehicle information aggregator for UK and Isle of Man registered vehicles.
          Enter any registration number to instantly access comprehensive data including MOT history,
          tax status, vehicle specifications, mileage tracking, and auction history - all in one place.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- How It Works -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">How It Works</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          When you search for a registration, CarScratch queries multiple data sources simultaneously
          and combines the results into a single, easy-to-read report. The entire lookup typically
          takes 2-5 seconds depending on the vehicle type.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-4 rounded">
          <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>You enter a registration number</li>
            <li>We detect whether it's a UK or Isle of Man plate</li>
            <li>Parallel requests are made to relevant data sources</li>
            <li>Results are aggregated, validated and displayed</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Data Sources -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Data Sources</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          All data displayed on CarScratch is sourced from official government APIs and publicly
          available information. We do not store or cache personal data.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-500 mb-2">DVLA Vehicle Enquiry Service</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
              Official UK government API providing vehicle details including make, model, colour,
              fuel type, engine size, CO2 emissions, tax status, and MOT status.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-500 mb-2">MOT History API</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
              Official DVSA API providing complete MOT test history including test results,
              mileage readings, advisories, failures, and dangerous defects.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-500 mb-2">Isle of Man Government</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
              Official gov.im vehicle search for Manx registrations. Provides make, model,
              colour, engine size, fuel type, tax status, and previous UK registration details.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-500 mb-2">IOM Auction Site</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
              Isle of Man vehicle auction data showing if a vehicle has appeared at auction,
              including the auction date, lot description, and hammer price (if sold).
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-500 mb-2">TotalCarCheck</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
              Supplementary vehicle data including performance specs (BHP, top speed),
              insurance group, ULEZ/CAZ compliance, and market pricing information.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Technical Details -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Technical Details</h2>
        <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-4 rounded">
          <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
            <div>
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Framework</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium">Astro with SSR</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Styling</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium">Tailwind CSS v4</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Hosting</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium">Netlify Functions</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-slate-500">HTML Parsing</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium">Cheerio</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Source Code</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium">
                <a href="https://github.com/JavierIOM/CarScratch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400">
                  GitHub
                </a>
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Version</dt>
              <dd class="font-medium">v1.4.1</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Registration Formats -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Supported Registration Formats</h2>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-400 mb-2">UK Plates</h3>
            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-400 space-y-1">
              <li><code class="bg-slate-700 px-1 rounded">AB12 CDE</code> - Current (2001+)</li>
              <li><code class="bg-slate-700 px-1 rounded">A12 XYZ</code> - Prefix (1983-2001)</li>
              <li><code class="bg-slate-700 px-1 rounded">ABC 123D</code> - Suffix (1963-1983)</li>
              <li><code class="bg-slate-700 px-1 rounded">ABC 123</code> - Dateless</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-800/50 border border-slate-700 p-4">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-red-400 mb-2">Isle of Man Plates</h3>
            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-400 space-y-1">
              <li><code class="bg-slate-700 px-1 rounded">PMN 147 E</code> - Classic</li>
              <li><code class="bg-slate-700 px-1 rounded">MAN 123</code> - MAN prefix</li>
              <li><code class="bg-slate-700 px-1 rounded">1-MN-00</code> - Modern</li>
              <li><code class="bg-slate-700 px-1 rounded">79NMN</code> - Numbers first</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Privacy & Data Protection -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Privacy & Data Protection</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed mb-4">
          CarScratch does not store vehicle lookup data or track individual searches.
          All queries are processed in real-time and results are not cached beyond the
          current session. We use no analytics or tracking cookies.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          This service does not breach GDPR or any data protection regulations. All vehicle
          data displayed is already publicly available through official government services
          and public records. Vehicle registration data is not considered personal data as
          it relates to the vehicle, not to any individual. We simply aggregate publicly
          accessible information into a convenient format - no private or protected data
          is collected, processed, or stored.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Disclaimer -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          All information is provided for general informational purposes only. While we strive
          for accuracy, CarScratch makes no warranties about the completeness, reliability,
          or accuracy of the data displayed. Always verify important information with official
          sources before making decisions. Vehicle data may be subject to change and may not
          reflect the current state of the vehicle.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Feedback</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Have a suggestion or found an issue? Use our
          <a href="/suggestions" class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400">Suggestion Box</a>
          to let us know. You can also contribute to the project on
          <a href="https://github.com/JavierIOM/CarScratch" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400">GitHub</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Back to home -->
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-700">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Vehicle Lookup
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
